#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:-1
msgid "Intelligent Mission Environment from Mattermost"
msgstr "OKR.BEST의 Intelligent Mission Environment"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "개요"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:21
msgid "The Intelligent Mission Environment (IME)"
msgstr "Intelligent Mission Environment(IME)"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:23
msgid ""
"Mattermost is an Intelligent Mission Environment (IME), purpose-built for"
" mission-critical operations. It delivers a unified platform for secure, "
"extensible, AI-powered collaboration and automation, deployable across "
"the most demanding environments—from classified networks to the tactical "
"edge. Organizations use Mattermost to maintain full control over "
"communications, workflows, and infrastructure while accelerating "
"decision-making."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 미션 크리티컬 작전을 위해 특별히 설계된 Intelligent Mission "
"Environment(IME)입니다. 기밀 네트워크부터 전술 현장(tactical edge)까지 가장 "
"까다로운 환경 전반에 배포할 수 있는, 안전하고 확장 가능하며 AI 기반의 "
"협업·자동화 통합 플랫폼을 제공합니다. 조직은 OKR.BEST를 사용해 커뮤니케이션, "
"워크플로, 인프라에 대한 완전한 통제력을 유지하면서 의사 결정을 가속화합니다."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:25
msgid ""
"IME integrates secure messaging, workflow automation, task management, "
"agentic AI, and real-time communication within a sovereign, cyber-"
"resilient architecture. It supports extensibility through open APIs and "
"integrations, and runs flexibly across on-premises, cloud, and air-gapped"
" systems—enabling operational focus, adaptability, and resilience from "
"edge nodes to centralized data centers."
msgstr ""
"IME는 주권적이고 사이버 회복탄력성을 갖춘 아키텍처 안에서 보안 메시징, "
"워크플로 자동화, 작업 관리, 에이전트형 AI, 실시간 커뮤니케이션을 통합합니다. "
"개방형 API와 통합을 통한 확장성을 지원하며 온프레미스, 클라우드, 에어갭 "
"시스템 전반에서 유연하게 실행되어 엣지 노드부터 중앙 데이터 센터까지 운영 "
"집중력, 적응성, 회복탄력성을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:27
msgid ""
"Infographic titled \"Mattermost: The Intelligent Mission Environment\", "
"showcasing Mattermost as an AI-powered, self-hosted collaboration "
"platform for defense, security, and critical enterprises. It highlights "
"use cases in Cyber Defense, Development, Security, and Operations "
"(DevSecOps), and Mission Operations; a secure collaborative workflow with"
" messaging, automation, audio/screenshare, project tracking, and AI "
"tools; an integration platform with extensible architecture; and a "
"deployment solution with Kubernetes-based, cyber-resilient scalability."
msgstr ""
"\"Mattermost: The Intelligent Mission Environment\"라는 제목의 "
"인포그래픽으로, OKR.BEST를 국방·보안·핵심 기업을 위한 AI 기반 셀프 호스팅 "
"협업 플랫폼으로 소개합니다. 사이버 방어, 개발·보안·운영(DevSecOps), 임무 수행 "
"활용 사례, 메시징·자동화·오디오/화면 공유·프로젝트 추적·AI 도구를 갖춘 보안 "
"협업 워크플로, 확장 가능한 아키텍처의 통합 플랫폼, Kubernetes 기반 사이버 "
"회복탄력성 확장성을 갖춘 배포 솔루션을 강조합니다."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:31
msgid ""
"It is designed to meet the evolving needs of national security, defense, "
"intelligence, cybersecurity, and critical infrastructure sectors for "
"mission-critical workflows, including:"
msgstr ""
"국가 안보, 국방, 정보, 사이버 보안, 핵심 인프라 분야의 진화하는 미션 크리티컬 "
"워크플로 요구를 충족하도록 설계되었으며, 다음을 포함합니다:"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Cyber Defense**: Secure, out-of-band communications and automation for "
"Security Operation Center (SOC)/Computer Emergency Response Team (CERT) "
"workflows."
msgstr ""
"**사이버 방어**: 보안관제센터(SOC)/침해사고대응팀(CERT) 워크플로를 위한 "
"안전한 대역 외(out-of-band) 커뮤니케이션과 자동화."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:34
msgid ""
"**DevSecOps**: Sovereign Continuous Integration Continuous delivery "
"(CI/CD), Information technology service management (ITSM), and digital "
"system management at scale."
msgstr ""
"**DevSecOps**: 주권적 지속 통합·지속 배포(CI/CD), IT 서비스 관리(ITSM), "
"대규모 디지털 시스템 관리."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Mission Operations**: Collaboration across command, control, "
"manufacturing, energy, and joint operations."
msgstr "**임무 수행**: 지휘, 통제, 제조, 에너지, 합동 작전 전반의 협업."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:37
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`Use Case Guide </use-case-guide/use-cases-index>` to learn "
"how operational teams use Mattermost to accelerate mission-critical work "
"across a wide variety of disciplines."
msgstr ""
"다양한 분야의 운영 팀이 OKR.BEST로 미션 크리티컬 업무를 가속화하는 방법은 "
":doc:`활용 사례 가이드 </use-case-guide/use-cases-index>`\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:40
msgid "Secure collaborative workflow"
msgstr "보안 협업 워크플로"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:42
msgid ""
"Built on an extensible open-core architecture, Mattermost offers an array"
" of collaborative tools across :doc:`managed Windows, Mac, or Linux "
"desktop applications </deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment>`,"
" secure web browsers with or without internet access, bring your own "
"device (BYOD) or :doc:`mobile device management (MDM)-managed mobile "
"</security-guide/mobile-security>`, and :doc:`embedded Microsoft 365 "
"</integrations-guide/mattermost-mission-collaboration-for-m365>` user "
"experiences."
msgstr ""
"확장 가능한 오픈 코어 아키텍처를 기반으로 OKR.BEST는 :doc:`관리형 "
"Windows·Mac·Linux 데스크톱 애플리케이션 </deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-"
"app-deployment>`, 인터넷 연결 여부와 무관한 보안 웹 브라우저, BYOD 또는 "
":doc:`모바일 기기 관리(MDM) 관리형 모바일 </security-guide/mobile-"
"security>`, :doc:`임베디드 Microsoft 365 </integrations-guide/mattermost-"
"mission-collaboration-for-m365>` 사용자 경험 전반에 걸쳐 다양한 협업 도구를 "
"제공합니다."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:45
msgid "Messaging collaboration"
msgstr "메시징 협업"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:47
msgid ""
":doc:`Mattermost Channels </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>` "
"enables secure, real-time and asynchronous communication across web, "
"desktop, and mobile—powering mission-critical collaboration and Chat "
"Operations (ChatOps) workflows across connected, hybrid, and air-gapped "
"environments. Channels feature the following capabilities:"
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST 채널 </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`\\ 은 웹, "
"데스크톱, 모바일 전반에서 안전한 실시간·비동기 커뮤니케이션을 지원하여 "
"연결·하이브리드·에어갭 환경 전반의 미션 크리티컬 협업과 챗옵스(ChatOps) "
"워크플로를 구동합니다. 채널은 다음 기능을 제공합니다:"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:49
msgid ""
":ref:`Public <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:public channels>` "
"and :ref:`private <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:private "
"channels>` channels, :ref:`direct messages <end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/channel-types:direct message channels>`, and :doc:`threaded "
"conversations </end-user-guide/collaborate/organize-conversations>` for "
"structured operational coordination."
msgstr ""
"체계적인 작전 조율을 위한 :ref:`공개 <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"types:public channels>` 및 :ref:`비공개 <end-user-guide/collaborate"
"/channel-types:private channels>` 채널, :ref:`개인 메시지 <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/channel-types:direct message channels>`, :doc:`스레드 "
"대화 </end-user-guide/collaborate/organize-conversations>`."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:50
msgid ""
":doc:`Role-based access controls </end-user-guide/collaborate/learn-"
"about-roles>` and :ref:`audit logs <administration-"
"guide/manage/logging:audit logging>` to support need-to-know enforcement."
msgstr ""
"알 필요성(need-to-know) 원칙 적용을 지원하는 :doc:`역할 기반 접근 제어 "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/learn-about-roles>`\\ 와 :ref:`감사 로그 "
"<administration-guide/manage/logging:audit logging>`."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:51
msgid ""
"Configurable :doc:`notifications </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"your-notifications>` (e.g., :ref:`alerts <end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-notifications:default notifications>`, :doc:`keyword "
"triggers </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-"
"notifications>`, :doc:`muting </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"channel-specific-notifications>`) to surface high-priority activity."
msgstr ""
"우선순위 높은 활동을 드러내는 구성 가능한 :doc:`알림 </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications>`\\ (예: :ref:`경보 <end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications:default notifications>`, "
":doc:`키워드 트리거 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-"
"keywords-notifications>`, :doc:`음소거 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"your-channel-specific-notifications>`)."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:52
msgid ""
"Integrated ChatOps capabilities via :doc:`slash commands </integrations-"
"guide/run-slash-commands>`, `bots "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/integrate/reference/bot-accounts/>`_, "
"and :doc:`webhooks </integrations-guide/webhook-integrations>` for real-"
"time automation and system alerts."
msgstr ""
"실시간 자동화와 시스템 경보를 위한 :doc:`슬래시 명령어 </integrations-"
"guide/run-slash-commands>`, `봇 "
"<https://developers.mattermost.com/integrate/reference/bot-accounts/>`_, "
":doc:`웹훅 </integrations-guide/webhook-integrations>` 기반의 통합 챗옵스 "
"기능."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:53
msgid ""
":ref:`Pinning <end-user-guide/collaborate/save-pin-messages:pin "
"messages>`, :doc:`bookmarking </end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-"
"channel-bookmarks>`, and :doc:`advanced search </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/search-for-messages>` to maintain continuity and "
"context in high-volume environments."
msgstr ""
"대용량 환경에서 연속성과 맥락을 유지하기 위한 :ref:`고정 <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/save-pin-messages:pin messages>`, :doc:`북마크 </end-"
"user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks>`, :doc:`고급 검색 </end-"
"user-guide/collaborate/search-for-messages>`."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:54
msgid ""
"Cross-platform support on web, desktop, and mobile clients for flexible "
"field to command and control access."
msgstr ""
"현장부터 지휘 통제까지 유연한 접근을 위한 웹, 데스크톱, 모바일 클라이언트 "
"크로스 플랫폼 지원."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:56
msgid ""
"An image showing Mattermost messaging collaboration, highlighting the "
"ability to create public and private channels, direct messages, and "
"threaded conversations for secure, real-time communication across web, "
"desktop, and mobile."
msgstr ""
"공개·비공개 채널, 개인 메시지, 스레드 대화를 만들어 웹, 데스크톱, 모바일 "
"전반에서 안전한 실시간 커뮤니케이션을 할 수 있음을 보여 주는 OKR.BEST 메시징 "
"협업 이미지."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:59
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`Client availability </end-user-guide/access/client-"
"availability>` documentation to learn which features are available on "
"different Mattermost clients."
msgstr ""
"클라이언트별로 사용할 수 있는 기능은 :doc:`클라이언트 가용성 </end-user-"
"guide/access/client-availability>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:62
msgid "Workflow automation"
msgstr "워크플로 자동화"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:64
msgid ""
":doc:`Mattermost Playbooks </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>` "
"standardizes and automates mission workflows such as incident response, "
"shift changeovers, and operational checklists—reducing human error and "
"improving procedural consistency. Playbooks feature:"
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST 플레이북 </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>`\\ 은 사고 "
"대응, 교대 인수인계, 운영 체크리스트 같은 임무 워크플로를 표준화·자동화하여 "
"인적 오류를 줄이고 절차 일관성을 높입니다. 플레이북의 기능은 다음과 같습니다:"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:66
msgid ""
"Structured :ref:`checklists <end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-"
"with-playbooks:make checklists>` with assigned :ref:`tasks and due dates "
"<end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks:tasks and due dates>`"
" to operationalize standard and incident or emergency operating "
"procedures."
msgstr ""
"표준 절차와 사고·비상 운영 절차를 실행 가능하게 만드는, 담당자와 :ref:`작업 "
"및 기한 <end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-tasks:tasks and due "
"dates>`\\ 이 지정된 체계적인 :ref:`체크리스트 <end-user-guide/workflow-"
"automation/work-with-playbooks:make checklists>`."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:67
msgid ""
"Automated :doc:`status updates and real-time notifications </end-user-"
"guide/workflow-automation/notifications-and-updates>` in linked channels "
"to keep stakeholders informed of workflow progress or blockers."
msgstr ""
"이해관계자에게 워크플로 진행 상황이나 차단 요소를 알리는, 연결된 채널의 자동 "
":doc:`상태 업데이트와 실시간 알림 </end-user-guide/workflow-automation"
"/notifications-and-updates>`."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:68
msgid ""
"Embedded :ref:`actions , assignments, and guidance <end-user-guide"
"/workflow-automation/work-with-playbooks:actions>` for repeatable "
"execution to ensure operational consistency."
msgstr ""
"운영 일관성을 보장하는 반복 실행을 위한 내장 :ref:`액션, 할당, 안내 <end-"
"user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-playbooks:actions>`."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:69
msgid ""
"Timeline, :ref:`retrospectives <end-user-guide/workflow-automation/learn-"
"about-playbooks:retrospective>`, and :ref:`metric tracking <end-user-"
"guide/workflow-automation/metrics-and-goals:metrics>` for after-action "
"reviews and accountability."
msgstr ""
"사후 검토와 책임성을 위한 타임라인, :ref:`회고 <end-user-guide/workflow-"
"automation/learn-about-playbooks:retrospective>`, :ref:`지표 추적 <end-"
"user-guide/workflow-automation/metrics-and-goals:metrics>`."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:70
msgid ""
"Integration :ref:`triggers <end-user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-"
"runs:send outgoing webhooks>` (e.g., alerts from monitoring tools) to "
"launch workflows automatically and decrease time to execution."
msgstr ""
"워크플로를 자동으로 시작해 실행까지의 시간을 줄이는 통합 :ref:`트리거 <end-"
"user-guide/workflow-automation/work-with-runs:send outgoing "
"webhooks>`\\ (예: 모니터링 도구의 경보)."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:72
msgid ""
"An image showing Mattermost playbooks, highlighting the ability to create"
" structured checklists with tasks and due dates, automate status updates,"
" and track metrics for operational workflows."
msgstr ""
"작업과 기한이 있는 체계적인 체크리스트 생성, 상태 업데이트 자동화, 운영 "
"워크플로 지표 추적 기능을 보여 주는 OKR.BEST 플레이북 이미지."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:76
msgid "Audio and screenshare"
msgstr "오디오 및 화면 공유"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:78
msgid ""
":doc:`Mattermost Calls </end-user-guide/collaborate/audio-and-"
"screensharing>` enables real-time communication and troubleshooting "
"through sovereign audio calling and screen sharing—supporting secure "
"knowledge transfer and fast response in time-sensitive scenarios. Key "
"capabilities include:"
msgstr ""
":doc:`OKR.BEST 통화 </end-user-guide/collaborate/audio-and-"
"screensharing>`\\ 는 주권적 오디오 통화와 화면 공유를 통한 실시간 "
"커뮤니케이션과 문제 해결을 지원하여, 시간이 중요한 상황에서 안전한 지식 "
"전달과 빠른 대응을 가능하게 합니다. 주요 기능은 다음과 같습니다:"

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:80
msgid ""
"Enables :ref:`1:1 and group audio calls <end-user-guide/collaborate/make-"
"calls:join a call>` directly within channels and direct messages, "
"maintaining contextual awareness and access control based on channel "
"membership."
msgstr ""
"채널과 개인 메시지 안에서 바로 :ref:`1:1 및 그룹 오디오 통화 <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/make-calls:join a call>`\\ 를 지원하여 채널 멤버십 기반의 "
"맥락 인식과 접근 제어를 유지합니다."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:81
msgid ""
"Supports secure :ref:`screen sharing <end-user-guide/collaborate/make-"
"calls:share your screen>` for visual coordination and analysis."
msgstr ""
"시각적 조율과 분석을 위한 안전한 :ref:`화면 공유 <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/make-calls:share your screen>`\\ 를 지원합니다."

#: ../../source/product-overview/product-overview-index.rst:82
msgid ""
"Operates in :doc:`sovereign, air-gapped, or sensitive network "
"</administration-guide/configure/calls-deployment-guide>` environments."
msgstr ""
":doc:`주권적·에어갭·민감 네트워크 </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
